      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\"\n\t\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">\n\n<head profile=\"http://gmpg.org/xfn/11\">\n\n\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n\n\t<title>Onekopakaspace</title>\n\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wicketpixie-theme-files/reset.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen, projection\" />\t\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wicketpixie-theme-files/screen.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen, projection\" />\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wicketpixie-theme-files/print.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\" />\n\n\t<link rel=\"license\" href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/us/\" />\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wicketpixie-theme-files/wicketpixie-tweaks.css\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"screen, projection\" />\n\t<meta name=\"msvalidate.01\" content=\"E3AB473796B20C7C400A7114FE9496CE\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\t<!-- header -->\n\t<div id=\"header\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- header-inner -->\n\t\t<div id=\"header-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div id=\"logo\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://buyvm.theoks.net/\">Onekopakaspace</a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /header-inner -->\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /header -->\n\n\t<!-- nav -->\n\t<div id=\"nav\">\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://blog.theoks.net/\">Blog</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://wiki.theoks.net/wiki/Main_Page\">Wiki</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://forum.theoks.net\">Forums</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/custom-streams-player/\">Custom Streams</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/speedtest/\">Speedtest</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- /nav -->\n\n\t<!-- wrapper -->\n\t<div id=\"wrapper\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- mid -->\n\t\t<div id=\"mid\" class=\"content\">\n\n\t\t\t<!-- content -->\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Welcome to Onekopakaspace!</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Onekopakaspace is not a normal website. Onekopakaspace is a small, quaint community of experienced computer users, programmers, gamers, and some that are a mix of all of those.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Onekopakaspace had long been home-hosted, but no longer is. With its start on an HP Pavilion desktop, and its revival on a Mac mini, it has found another new life on a VPS in Las Vegas.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>We operate several game servers, most notably <a href=\"http://minecraft.net/\">Minecraft</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- content -->\n\n\t\t\t<!-- sidebar -->\n\t\t\t<div id=\"sidebar\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- no use for sidebar -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- sidebar -->\n\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<!-- /mid -->\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"clearer\"></div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- wrapper -->\n\t<!-- footer -->\n\t<div id=\"footer\">\n\t\t<p id=\"footer-credits\" class=\"left\">&copy; 2011-2021 Onekopakaspace \n\t\t| <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/us/\"><img alt=\"Creative Commons License\" style=\"border-width:0\" src=\"https://licensebuttons.net/l/by-nc-sa/3.0/us/80x15.png\" /></a></p>\t\n\t\t<p id=\"footer-meta\" class=\"right\">Uses WicketPixie WordPress Theme CSS.</p>\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"clearer\"></div>\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- footer -->\n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n",
